# Regression fixture (docs/projects/ai_tooling_next_steps.md): two
# alternatives sharing a factorable leading term where the longer suffix
# (WS?) is nullable but non-empty and the shorter is the true epsilon.
# The nullable, non-empty suffix unit has no committed dispatch -- no
# guard set can be planned for it -- and this shape used to fall through
# to the streaming emitter and segfault on the missing guard set.
# pg_report_choice must reject it at generation time instead; the build
# step asserts the exact diagnostic.
parser edge_probe
mode streaming
token IDENT letters
token WS spaces
start value
rule value = IDENT WS? | IDENT
